    store: false,
    max_output_tokens: 100,
    instructions: "Classify the supplied opportunity only. Return client_project only when a client/company seeks to commission an AI automation, n8n workflow, AI agent, integration, consulting, or implementation project. Return client_hiring for employment hiring, provider_offer when a developer/agency offers services, and irrelevant otherwise. Do not invent facts.",
